00:09:26.520 --> 00:09:27.750
Technique

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:30.750
You really put up a good fight, though.

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:34.210
Yeah, when I hit strong 
shots with good control,

00:09:34.210 --> 00:09:36.410
I felt like I could win some points, but...

00:09:36.410 --> 00:09:37.760
Oh, Takuma-san.

00:09:40.230 --> 00:09:41.300
What brings you here?

00:09:41.300 --> 00:09:43.520
They're having a mini-camp over here.

00:09:44.380 --> 00:09:47.520
Takuma-san, I made it into the top four!

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:50.340
And you're playing Nabae tomorrow?

00:09:50.340 --> 00:09:51.540
That'll be tough.

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:54.890
Yeah, you haven't been able to beat 
him these past few years, either.

00:09:56.690 --> 00:09:57.940
I'm sorry!

00:09:57.940 --> 00:10:02.030
Nabae-kun doesn't have any physical 
or psychological weaknesses.

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:04.040
I have no idea how to strategize.

00:10:04.320 --> 00:10:08.290
When he was younger, 
he had a huge weakness.

00:10:08.290 --> 00:10:10.310
What? Nabae-kun did?

00:10:10.310 --> 00:10:12.540
Oh, yeah, I guess you don't know.

00:10:12.850 --> 00:10:16.010
Nabae and I have been playing 
each other since we were kids.

00:10:16.010 --> 00:10:18.800
He had serious psychological issues.

00:10:19.110 --> 00:10:20.400
Psychological?

00:10:20.400 --> 00:10:21.800
First I've heard of that.

00:10:22.020 --> 00:10:25.890
He would lose his temper 
even more than Araya.

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:32.810
No way...

00:10:33.040 --> 00:10:35.910
Well, I don't know how he got over it,

00:10:35.910 --> 00:10:38.570
but his mental fortitude 
is pretty unshakable now.

00:10:39.750 --> 00:10:41.670
Oh, Takuma, you're here.

00:10:41.670 --> 00:10:44.520
I never thought I'd stay here again.

00:10:44.520 --> 00:10:46.290
Now, don't say that.

00:10:47.300 --> 00:10:51.080
The point is, even Nabae isn't perfect.

00:10:51.620 --> 00:10:53.090
Do your best tomorrow.

00:10:53.090 --> 00:10:56.090
Okay! Thank you!

